{
  "_fixture_note": [
    "Raw state v4 with the three shapes awkward.tfstate.json deliberately does",
    "not have — the plan names all three as where the live defect would be.",
    "Field spellings verified against terraform on `main` (2026-08-08),",
    "internal/states/statefile/version4.go:693-710:",
    "    resourceStateV4.ProviderConfig  `json:\"provider\"`",
    "    instanceObjectStateV4.Status    `json:\"status,omitempty\"`     (\"tainted\")",
    "    instanceObjectStateV4.Deposed   `json:\"deposed,omitempty\"`",
    "    instanceObjectStateV4.AttributesRaw  `json:\"attributes,omitempty\"`",
    "    instanceObjectStateV4.AttributesFlat `json:\"attributes_flat,omitempty\"`",
    "",
    "1. TWO ACCOUNTS, distinguished only by a provider alias. A state file",
    "   carries no account id of its own; the only places one appears are an",
    "   `arn` attribute and, indirectly, the provider *configuration* address.",
    "   aws_route.dr_default is the case decision 10 exists for: it lives in the",
    "   DR account, it has no `arn` attribute, and before the alias was read it",
    "   carried no provenance at all.",
    "",
    "2. LEGACY FLATMAP instances. A pre-0.12 provider stored attributes as a",
    "   string map under `attributes_flat`, so `attributes` is absent entirely.",
    "   Reading only `attributes` saw {} and emitted id = \"\" while the real id",
    "   sat one key away. aws_route53_record.legacy proves a composite rule reads",
    "   flatmap fine (every part is a top-level key); aws_security_group_rule",
    "   .legacy_ingress proves one cannot, because flatmap flattens the",
    "   cidr_blocks list to `cidr_blocks.#` / `cidr_blocks.0`.",
    "",
    "3. A TAINTED object (aws_instance.web). Same destroy-and-recreate hazard",
    "   class as deposed and far more common — but unlike a deposed object it",
    "   still exists and is still importable, so it is emitted, not skipped.",
    "",
    "Every id here is faithful to what terraform-provider-aws actually stores.",
    "Terraform never reads this file; the leading-underscore key is for readers."
  ],
